e=\"width: 19.943%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>고양이</td>\n<td>파란색 냥이</td>\n<td>검은색 냥이</td>\n<td>보라색 냥이</td>\n<td>하얀색 냥이</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>마리</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li>공부를 하지 마세요.</li>\n<li>샤워를 하지 마세요.</li>\n<li>음식을 먹지 마세요.</li>\n<li>호흡을 하지 마세요.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"6\" data-is-empty=\"false\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1418-1.png\" data-size=\"1280x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1418-1-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/Screenshot_20260820_165628_Opera-1.jpg\" data-size=\"1440x1524\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/Screenshot_20260820_165628_Opera-1-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"762\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/Screenshot_20260820_165555_Google.jpg\" data-size=\"815x1398\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/Screenshot_20260820_165555_Google-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"1235\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1291.png\" data-size=\"1280x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1291-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1372_20260627120643.png\" data-size=\"1280x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1372_20260627120643-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1240.png\" data-size=\"1280x1280\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://momun-create.github.io/mysite/media/posts/1/gallery/muje1240-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p><strong>짱</strong><strong>이 되</strong><strong>는 법!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>밥먹기</li>\n<li>유튜브하기</li>\n<li>편집하기</li>\n<li>코딩하기</li>\n<li>게임하기</li>\n<li>라면먹기</li>\n<li>미쿠미쿠!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>왜이렇게 두서가 없는지에 대한 답변</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>두서가 없는것은 사람이 만든 개념이며 그러하다면 내가 그 두서의 개념을 깨버리면 돼지(돼~지)</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p>와 ! 샌즈! 아시는구나 참고로 겁.나.어.렵.답.니.다</p>\n<p>근데 진짜 왜 여기까지옴? ㅓ이없네 그냥 여기 오래있지말고 할거하쇼~</p>\n<p>아 내 사이트 괴담채널에 \" 깃허브를 뒤지다 정체불명의 사이트를 발견했다 \" 로 나오면 좋겠다 ㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎㅎ</p>\n<p>나오면 좋겠는 채널</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>캬랑</li>\n<li>네이트판</li>\n<li>뉴스</li>\n<li>판테리</li>\n<li>세모미</li>\n<li>기타 내가 좋아하는 괴담 유튜버</li>\n</ul>\n<p>나의정체는 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@daldere_15\" title=\"달드레\">달드레</a>이다! 왜 momun(모문)이라 뜨냐면<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@daldere_15\" title=\"달드레\"></a></p>\n<p>내 유튜브와 일러스트/애니메이션 닉네임은 달드레이지만 개발명은 모문이기 때문이다!</p>\n<p>오늘의 TMI끝! 내일 다시 올수도 있어.</p>\n<p>26.10.31</p>",
